-- **Sensitivity (CONTENT_POLICY §2.3 and §4; GDD owner ruling 1; impact plan §4.2 and §4.3).** No Phase 5 rule may reward harm to civilians, from any side:
-  - Combat acts on combatant units only. Residents are never a target, a unit, a count that combat changes, or a source of any resource or score.
