-**Goal:** Deport, as the owner confirms §4.1:
-- the immediate Social cohesion and International Support costs, and a permanent International Support drag for the rest of the game, recorded in `DisplacedByPlayer`;
-- the residents become a displaced population outside the player's control: never refugee units, labour, housing occupants or score;
-- the settlement becomes `depopulated`, which adds nothing (constraint 2) and ends the Occupy timer;
-- the buildings follow D-F3 (Q-DEP-4), and are never usable housing in the MVP;
-- `DeportNeverDominates` holds.
