-- **R-CTRL-022**: `DeportNeverDominates`: from any state where Deport is offered, its outcome is less than or equal to Raid's and Occupy's on every resource, parameter and score, at the end of the turn and at the MVP's end (§4.1 item 5), and on whatever Q-DEP-7 adds.
