-## Not in Phase 7 (and why)
-
-- **Steam.** The Steam store page, Steamworks and Steam features are #424's and #45's track (O5, O11). The MVP's first release is the GitHub pre-release (O9).
-- **New mechanics for low cohesion or low support.** Q-NAT-3 (decided) made them situations that events read; PR 3 may add events gated on them, and nothing else.
-- **Diplomacy, the legislature and the eras after 1951.** D-C5 defers diplomacy; G2 pauses the eras until after the MVP.
-- **Settlement-control texts.** Phase 6 and D-F1; the end screen adds no text about captured or depopulated places.
-- **Historian review.** Planned for M4 and not a gate (`docs/HISTORIAN_REVIEW.md`).
